OL,3,GNEWSAEnd in sight after year-long
OL,4,Aroadworks 'struggle'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than a year of "struggle" caused
OL,7,Fby roadworks is nearly at an end, a
OL,8,Ftown's business leader says.
OL,10,FThe Longfield Gyratory project in
OL,11,FTrowbridge, Wiltshire, started in July
OL,12,F2025 and was due to be completed in
OL,13,FApril, but the discovery of an
OL,14,Funderground high-voltage cable delayed
OL,15,Fpart of the work.
OL,17,FThe daytime closures which have
OL,18,Fimpacted motorists and firms are now
OL,19,Fcomplete, although the final stages
OL,20,Fwill continue at night until 2
OL,21,FDecember.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
