OL,3,GNEWSAEnd in sight after year-long
OL,4,Aroadworks 'struggle'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCarey Tasler, who is chair of the
OL,7,FTrowbridge Chamber of Commerce, said:
OL,8,F"I think it's been a struggle and a
OL,9,Fgreat challenge for everybody who lives
OL,10,Fin Trowbridge and everyone passing
OL,11,Fthrough."
